@startuml
title Cancellation Strategy with an abstract Ruby contract
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
abstract class CancellationPolicy {
  cancellable?(booking, at:)
  refund_amount(booking, at:)
}
class CancellationService {
  initialize(booking, policy:)
  call(at:)
}
class FlexibleCancellationPolicy
class PartialRefundCancellationPolicy
class NoRefundCancellationPolicy
CancellationService --> CancellationPolicy : delegates rules to injected policy
CancellationPolicy <|-- FlexibleCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- PartialRefundCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- NoRefundCancellationPolicy
note top of CancellationPolicy
  Ruby class with required methods
  raising NotImplementedError.
  Concrete policies inherit this class.
end note
@enduml
